mission "A Fleet in Open Water"
    name "A Fleet in Open Water"
    description "Sink the four blockade ships in the Blue Expanse, then sail to Blackwater Reach for the next signal."
    source "Port Azure"
    destination "Blackwater Reach"
    lead "Anne Bonny folds the report and marks Port Azure on your chart. “I am sailing there to meet a convoy master who has seen an unusual concentration of armed ships beyond the trade lanes. Meet me at the harbour when you reach that quarter; we will compare what he has seen with our own reports.”"
    reward 1150
    objective kills 4
    battlefield "The Blue Expanse" 5751.9 4840.0
    enemy "The Blue Expanse Guard 1"
    enemy "The Blue Expanse Guard 2"
    enemy "The Blue Expanse Guard 3"
    enemy "The Blue Expanse Guard 4"
    speaker offer "Commodore Anne Bonny"
    speaker visit "Commodore Anne Bonny"
    speaker complete "Commodore Anne Bonny"
    to offer
        has "The Western Return: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `At Port Azure, Commodore Bonny has received the convoy master’s report: four hired Company ships have formed a blockade in the Blue Expanse between the old Caribbean and the Leeward Reach.`
            `They are not protecting a port. They are forcing the free captains into a narrow approach where the Meridian Star can strike from behind.`
            `The battle is in open ocean, with no nearby island to shelter behind. Keep your escorts together and use the room to manoeuvre.`
            choice
                `(I will take this voyage. Tell me the course.)`
                    goto accept_job
                `(What makes this business so important?)`
                    goto more_details
                `(I have other waters to sail.)`
                    goto decline_job
            label more_details
                `The battle is in open ocean, with no nearby island to shelter behind. Keep your escorts together and use the room to manoeuvre.`
                choice
                    `(Then I will see it done.)`
                        goto accept_job
                    `(Not this time.)`
                        goto decline_job
            label accept_job
                `Bonny points to a broad empty patch of sea. “No reefs, no coves, no safe anchorage. Make the open water work for you.”`
                accept
            label decline_job
                `The officer nods and rolls the chart closed. The offer will remain here if you change your mind.`
                close
    on accept
        log "Accepted A Fleet in Open Water. Sink the four blockade ships in the Blue Expanse, then sail to Blackwater Reach for the next signal."
    on visit
        conversation
            `The blockade is broken. A captured signal book reveals that Ashcombe sent a false message toward Mariner's Rest to draw the free fleet away.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `The signal book gives you the real heading of the Meridian Star.`
        log "Completed A Fleet in Open Water. Received 1150 gold. The signal book gives you the real heading of the Meridian Star."
